# Un-ignore the repo guide: a global gitignore hides CLAUDE.md by default.
# This line and .tmp/ were fused into "!CLAUDE.md.tmp/" by a lost newline.
# Harmless — .tmp/ above already covered the ledger, and the fused pattern
# matched a directory that has never existed — but it read as intent.
!CLAUDE.md

